    "uncited": [
     "**Triangle Data Buffer:** Flat array of floats.",
     "**Voxel Table (`vtable`):** 1D array of 32-bit unsigned integers.",
     "Bit index $i$ corresponds to voxel linear index $i$.",
     "If $|n| > 10^{-20}$, normalize $n = n / |n|$.",
     "$t_{grid}.min = \\text{clamp}(\\lfloor t_{world}.min / unit \\rfloor, 0, gridsize - 1)$",
     "$d_{xy\\_e0} = -(n_{xy\\_e0} \\cdot (v_0.x, v_0.y)) + \\max(0, unit.x \\cdot n_{xy\\_e0}.x) + \\max(0, unit.y \\cdot n_{xy\\_e0}.y)$",
     "$d_{xy\\_e1} = -(n_{xy\\_e1} \\cdot (v_1.x, v_1.y)) + \\max(0, unit.x \\cdot n_{xy\\_e1}.x) + \\max(0, unit.y \\cdot n_{xy\\_e1}.y)$",
     "$d_{yz\\_e0} = -(n_{yz\\_e0} \\cdot (v_0.y, v_0.z)) + \\max(0, unit.y \\cdot n_{yz\\_e0}.x) + \\max(0, unit.z \\cdot n_{yz\\_e0}.y)$",
     "$d_{yz\\_e1} = -(n_{yz\\_e1} \\cdot (v_1.y, v_1.z)) + \\max(0, unit.y \\cdot n_{yz\\_e1}.x) + \\max(0, unit.z \\cdot n_{yz\\_e1}.y)$",
     "$d_{zx\\_e0} = -(n_{zx\\_e0} \\cdot (v_0.z, v_0.x)) + \\max(0, unit.x \\cdot n_{zx\\_e0}.x) + \\max(0, unit.z \\cdot n_{zx\\_e0}.y)$",
     "$d_{zx\\_e1} = -(n_{zx\\_e1} \\cdot (v_1.z, v_1.x)) + \\max(0, unit.x \\cdot n_{zx\\_e1}.x) + \\max(0, unit.z \\cdot n_{zx\\_e1}.y)$",
     "If $(nDOTp + d_1) \\cdot (nDOTp + d_2) > 0$, the voxel is outside the triangle slab.",
     "If $(n_{xy\\_e0} \\cdot p_{xy} + d_{xy\\_e0}) < 0$ OR $(n_{xy\\_e1} \\cdot p_{xy} + d_{xy\\_e1}) < 0$ OR $(n_{xy\\_e2} \\cdot p_{xy} + d_{xy\\_e2}) < 0$, the voxel is outside the XY projection.",
     "If $(n_{yz\\_e0} \\cdot p_{yz} + d_{yz\\_e0}) < 0$ OR $(n_{yz\\_e1} \\cdot p_{yz} + d_{yz\\_e1}) < 0$ OR $(n_{yz\\_e2} \\cdot p_{yz} + d_{yz\\_e2}) < 0$, the voxel is outside the YZ projection.",
     "If $(n_{zx\\_e0} \\cdot p_{zx} + d_{zx\\_e0}) < 0$ OR $(n_{zx\\_e1} \\cdot p_{zx} + d_{zx\\_e1}) < 0$ OR $(n_{zx\\_e2} \\cdot p_{zx} + d_{zx\\_e2}) < 0$, the voxel is outside the ZX projection.",
     "$loc = x + y \\cdot N_x + z \\cdot N_x \\cdot N_y$",
     "- Launch `extract_kernel` to iterate over all bits in `vtable`.",
     "- **Time Complexity:** $O(N_{tri} \\cdot N_{vox\\_per\\_tri})$, where $N_{tri}$ is the number of triangles and $N_{vox\\_per\\_tri}$ is the number of voxels in the triangle's bounding box."
    ]
